Name:           agents-usage
Version:        @VERSION@
Release:        1
Summary:        Lightweight tray utility for coding-agent account usage
License:        GPL-3.0-only
BuildArch:      @RPM_ARCH@
AutoReqProv:    yes

%description
Agents Usage is a compact GNOME/KDE tray utility for viewing usage across
local coding-agent accounts through the installed Codex App Server.

%prep

%build

%install
mkdir -p %{buildroot}
cp -a %{_stage}/. %{buildroot}/

%files
%{_bindir}/agents-usage
%{_datadir}/applications/io.github.agentsusagetray.AgentsUsage.desktop
%{_datadir}/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/agents-usage.svg
%{_datadir}/metainfo/io.github.agentsusagetray.AgentsUsage.metainfo.xml
%{_datadir}/gnome-shell/extensions/agents-usage@local/
%doc %{_defaultdocdir}/agents-usage/

%changelog
* Thu Aug 20 2026 Agents Usage maintainers <local@agents-usage.invalid> - @VERSION@-1
- Add usage-bar color modes and improve startup refresh and countdown stability.

* Wed Aug 19 2026 Agents Usage maintainers <local@agents-usage.invalid> - @VERSION@-1
- Improve popup dismissal, cached-startup feedback, and compact provider rendering.

* Wed Aug 19 2026 Agents Usage maintainers <local@agents-usage.invalid> - @VERSION@-1
- Improve refresh responsiveness, restore cached usage, and expand display settings.

* Mon Aug 17 2026 Agents Usage maintainers <local@agents-usage.invalid> - @VERSION@-1
- Improve refresh latency and persist expanded usage details.

* Sun Aug 16 2026 Agents Usage maintainers <local@agents-usage.invalid> - @VERSION@-1
- Fix launcher activation, popup sizing, refresh edge cases, and add KDE tray support.
